<title>USA: Newport News CEO sees flattish revs '96-'98.</title>
<headline>Newport News CEO sees flattish revs '96-'98.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport News Shipbuilding Inc Chief Executive and President William Fricks said on Thursday that he sees the company's revenue base being &quot;relatively flattish&quot; for the years 1996, 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>He said some revenue-enhancing programs should start to kick in in 1999.</p>
<p>At a luncheon on the day of Newport's spin-off from Tenneco Inc and its debut as an independent public company, Fricks declined to comment on specific earnings projections.</p>
</text>
